			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="0"]と　いう　名前！
とても　ステキ　よね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
