				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>■
・続けてmsg_intro_rival_01
</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
